stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Requested: IR1 a fact is cited to its research file and needs a row
    Requested --> Triaged: IR2 ledger owner confirms the fact is not already a row
    Triaged --> Merged: IR3 the fact is a component of an existing row
    Triaged --> Assigned: IR4 a ledger revision assigns an EV or EV-K ID
    Triaged --> Declined: IR5 no load-bearing use - the citation is removed
    Assigned --> Registered: IR6 row written with its grade, qualifiers and capture
    Registered --> Citable: IR7 citations re-pointed from the research file to the ID
    Merged --> Citable: IR7 citations re-pointed to the named component
    Citable --> [*]
    Declined --> [*]

    note right of Requested
        A rule version resting on the fact
        may be drafted, never published,
        while the request is open.
    end note
